      "text": "Non-functional Requirements\n- availability >> consistency \n- support files as large as 50GB\n    - Resumable uploads\n- low latency upload, download (as low as possible)\n- high data integrity (sync accuracy)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-functional Requirements\n- availability >> consistency \n- support files as large as 50GB\n    - Resumable uploads\n- low latency upload, download (as low as possible)\n- high data integrity (sync accuracy)",
